	(text "REF IN squarer: U13 74LVC1G17 on VDD (same rail as the TCXO squarer).\nJ5, 51 ohm to GND, 100 nF series, then 10k/10k self-bias at VDD/2.\n+13 dBm is about 2.8 Vpp into 50 ohm and stays inside the LVC input\nrange (5.5 V), so no series 100 ohm and no clamp.\nHysteresis of the '1G17 limits sensitivity; a 74LVC1GU04 with a feedback\nresistor is the alternative if more sensitivity is needed (near 0 dBm, 0.63 Vpp).\n33 ohm from the buffer onto REF_IN, which C58 couples into ADF4002 REFIN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 184.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0a127f36-1a12-4b3b-b463-12761f20604a")
	)
	(text "Comms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.042 242.062 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1e59667a-c007-4860-9ed8-3c330546ba96")
	)
	(text "Digital 3.3 V (VDD): ATtiny, FT231X VCCIO, ADF4002 DVDD, VCTCXO, REF buffer.\nFed from the VRF LP5907 through FB2. VVCO is its own LP5907. ADF4351 AVDD/Vp are on VRF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 444.246 76.454 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "21c47249-668b-487d-9b65-03795fbb163b")
	)
	(text "CBUS2 (pin 7) is the COMM LED, active low. Program it as TX&RXLED#.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 145.288 274.066 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "23a4f049-6c5e-46cd-ac00-cd3667b38965")
	)
	(text "Mounting holes H1-H4 (Hammond 1590LB, #6-32, 40.5 mm square) - bonded to GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.036 19.558 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39cce39c-a871-40ce-bb1b-3c15c268081b")
	)
	(text "REF_OUT: after U11, 39 ohm series and 100 pF to GND. RC edge softener, not a sine filter.\nVCTCXO output (XO) is AC-coupled to ADF4351 REFIN (C3), and to U11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.73 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3b89517c-ceac-44f4-8165-17bccdf90fb1")
	)
	(text "ADF4002 loop filter, about 20 Hz, 50 deg phase margin.\nKvco = 10 MHz * 20 ppm / 2 V = 100 Hz/V.\nIQXT-220-2 pulling is +/-10 to +/-15 ppm over Vc = 1.5 V +/- 1 V, so Kv is about 100-150 Hz/V. Designed at 100 Hz/V.\nPFD = 10 kHz with R = N = 1000 (10 MHz / 10 kHz). Lowest CP current: CPI=000, RSET=5.1k, Icp=0.625 mA.\nT1=(sec phi - tan phi)/wc = 2.90 ms, T2=1/(wc^2*T1)=21.9 ms.\nC1=1.5 nF C0G (CP to GND), R=2.2 M, C2=10 nF C0G (Vc to GND).\nFree-run hold: ATtiny DAC PA6 through 100 k to Vc. Tri-state the charge pump to hold; while locking, Icp overrides the 100 k.\nADF4002 REFIN is external /REF_IN (J5, 74LVC1G17 squarer, 33 ohm, then C58). RFIN is the VCTCXO sample.\nSPI CLK/DATA shared with the ADF4351. LE is PA7. MUXOUT (digital lock detect) is PA5.\nREFIN below 20 MHz needs slew > 50 V/us (ADF4002 datasheet). The 1G17 squares the 10 MHz reference so that slew is met."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 327.914 -3.048 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3bd473ae-4e8f-4b0a-9714-53887e17125b")
	)
	(text "PCB: 1.5 mm hole under each LED with GND via ring (waveguide below cutoff).\nReverse-mount Kingbright KPTL-3216. Light exits the bottom face.\nPWR and COMM are green KPTL-3216CGCK-01 (C598390). \nREF LOCK and SYNTH LOCK are red KPTL-3216SURCK-01 (C598393).\nBlue KPTL-3216QBC-D-01 is on LCSC but Vf is 3.3 V, so it is not used on this 3.3 V rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 178.054 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6b95df42-fe13-4c1a-8400-ab8ab2fa5fd0")
	)
	(text "What frequency range on output is required? all the way to 6 GHZ?\nWhat VCC/VDD pins require lowest noise? \nCan regulators be different noise levels on different pins to save $?\nOn Eval Kit for ADF4350, why only two regulators?\nHow does eval kit get away with one set or loop filter Rs and Cs?\nHow should loop filter components be distributed between CP side and TUNE side (to minimize pickup)\nWhat connector layout for board, what enclosure?\nShould MUX and LD outputs be routed to buffers and LEDs directly?\nWhat test points on board?  \n  - 0.025 posts for scope clips?\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.782 49.276 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6c39c1b3-5874-4de3-bf60-392c0b2151bb")
	)
	(text "Synth"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.598 141.224 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a0519c7a-e88e-467e-83ef-144187dfec86")
	)
	(text "Programming: J8 removed. MCU TX (TXD_M, PB2) drives FT231X RXD.\nFT231X TXD still drives MCU RX (RXD_M, PB3) through R16.\nUPDI is PA0 only, on J12 (UPDI, VDD, GND). Optiboot ersatz reset: DTR - 100 nF - PA4, 10 k to VDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c2b32757-1c60-4af0-aad5-c709b1d0e380")
	)
